+# Wire Format
+
+The project's recorded decision is to use CBOR as the wire serialisation format, on the grounds that it is more compact; this is tracked as the current value of the `wire-format` decision (most recently reaffirmed in commit f8e90b0) and remains in force, since no later decision has changed it.
